      "date": "2026-02-13T11:53:50.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹9.94 (vs ₹14.01 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.94 (down from ₹14.01 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹460.9m (up 3.2% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹55.7m (down 29% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 12% (down from 18% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 5% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 16% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
